      "value": "Hi there. There will be a canny opened up for impostors soon.\n\nWhile Impostors is \"live\" in the client, we had some issues that made it through that weren't picked up on until last minute that means anything that was impostorized today will likely be incorrectly rendered.\n\nWe will not be able to confirm until tomorrow whether or not our attempted fix at this is working -- that said, we are working on it.\n\nYou are welcome to try re-impostorizing later tonight, and you may see better results, but I cannot make any promises on that given how finnicky things have been today.",
